 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"font-medium\">Review Veg Hakka Noodles, Mutton Rogan Josh, Masala Papad</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Rework it, bundle it, or remove it to simplify the kitchen.</p></div></li></ul><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-muted-light\">Estimates based on the numbers you entered. Not a guarantee of results.</p></section><div class=\"no-print flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-4 shadow-card\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-line px-3 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-wash disabled:opacity-50 bg-inverse text-on-inverse hover:opacity-90\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-save h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.2 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.4.6l3.8 3.8a2 2 0 0 1 .6 1.4V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M17 21v-7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7\"></path><path d=\"M7 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7\"></path></svg> Save</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-card px-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-wash disabled:opacity-50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-share2 h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"></circle><line x1=\"8.59\" x2=\"15.42\" y1=\"13.51\" y2=\"17.49\"></line><line x1=\"15.41\" x2=\"8.59\" y1=\"6.51\" y2=\"10.49\"></line></svg> Share</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-card px-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-wash disabled:opacity-50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg> Copy</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-card px-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-wash disabled:opacity-50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> <!-- -->PDF</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-card px-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-wash disabled:opacity-50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-spreadsheet h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M8 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M14 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M8 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M14 17h2\"></path></svg> CSV</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-card px-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-wash disabled:opacity-50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-printer h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M6 9V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6\"></path><rect x=\"6\" y=\"14\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg> Print</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-card px-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-wash disabled:opacity-50 col-span-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg> Reset</button></div></div></div></div><section aria-labelledby=\"formula-title\" class=\"print-break rounded-2xl border border-line bg-inverse p-6 text-on-inverse sm:p-8\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-accent-bright\">Formula</p><h2 id=\"formula-title\" class=\"mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-on-inverse\">How the numbers are calculated</h2><dl class=\"mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Profit per unit</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Payout − (Dish cost + Labour + Packaging cost), using the Online Payout formula</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Total profit</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Profit per unit × Units sold</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Average profit</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Simple average of profit per unit across dishes</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Average popularity</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Simple average of units sold across dishes</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Star / Plow Horse / Puzzle / Dog</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Profit ≥ average and units ≥ average → Star; profit &lt; average, units ≥ average → Plow Horse; profit ≥ average, units &lt; average → Puzzle; otherwise Dog</dd></div></dl></section><section aria-labelledby=\"learn-title\" class=\"print-break\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-accent-dark\">Learn</p><h2 id=\"learn-title\" class=\"mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold\">Understanding <!-- -->menu engineering</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">What is this?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">A way to sort every dish by how well it sells and how much it earns per unit after platform deductions.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">How it works</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Each dish runs through the same payout calculation as the Online Payout calculator. Its profit per unit is compared with the average across the menu, and its units sold with the average units sold.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Why it matters</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">It shows which dishes deserve the best spots on your menu and in your ads, and which ones only keep the kitchen busy.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-accent-soft/60 p-5\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-4 w-4 text-accent-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> Worked example</h3><p class=\"tabular mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">A biryani selling 640 units with profit per unit above the menu average is a Star. A tandoori platter with high profit per unit but only 85 units sold is a Puzzle to promote.</p></div><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Common mistakes</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Judging dishes by food cost % instead of rupee profit per unit.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Leaving out labour and packaging cost.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Analysing too short a period; use a full month.</li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Ways to improve</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Put Stars and Puzzles at the top of the menu with the best photos.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Reprice Plow Horses in small steps.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Retire or rework Dogs that complicate prep.</li></ul></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-muted\">Reference ranges are indicative, drawn from common industry practice. The right numbers for your outlet depend on format, city, cuisine and pricing.</p></section><section aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\" class=\"no-print\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\" class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"mt-5 divide-y divide-line rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card\"><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">What CSV format does the import accept?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Columns with headers: Dish Name, Selling Price, Dish Cost, Labour, Packaging Cost, Units Sold. Export a file first to get the template. Older files with a single cost column still import.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">Why are commission, discount and ads entered only once?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">They&#x27;re usually the same for every dish on a platform, so every dish uses the same rates in the payout calculation.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">How many dishes can I analyse?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Up to 500. For best results, analyse one menu section, such as mains, at a time.</p></details></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What CSV format does the import accept?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Columns with headers: Dish Name, Selling Price, Dish Cost, Labour, Packaging Cost, Units Sold. Export a file first to get the template. Older files with a single cost column still import.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why are commission, discount and ads entered only once?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"They're usually the same for every dish on a platform, so every dish uses the same rates in the payout calculation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many dishes can I analyse?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Up to